### List invites (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List My Invites
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get One of My Invites
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Respond to an invite
### This currently returns 501 until authentication is implemented.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/invites/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACCEPTED"
}
